      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sort of related, but another example where object sync seems to fail completely can be found the test world for these cannies:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/845-spawning-a-complicated-object-breaks-broadcasting-within-the-spawned-object\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/open-beta/p/878-spawning-a-complicated-object-causes-the-client-to-freeze\n\nThe spawned object has 5 object syncs, 3 of which are visible. These objects fail to sync and just kind of float around. \nRepro steps:\n- Have two players enter the world\n- Have one hit the switch to spawn the object\n- Have either user grab the remote off the spawned character's back\n- Observe the remote doesn't properly follow the player's hand for the other clients.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
