      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Testing on build 884. While general object sync seems better than initial beta builds, when teleporting an object sync'ed object, the lerp for non owners is very slow and gradually returns to the position, potentially firing all enter triggers events along the way. While this is technically in live, the slow lerping will cause more issues than live.",
      "viewerReactions": null
