  "details": "See included screenshots.\nThe first screenshot shows a car in motion. The player's position is accurate (with a delay), but the vehicle's position and rotation is off. The vehicle should be facing the same direction as the player, but is instead rotated more than 90 degrees.\n\nThe second screenshot shows the car in very different positions. The car is stopped and not moving at all, but for the remote player it is far from the position it should be as shown for the owner.\n\nTested in the Not Bad Cars world:\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_357d4a0b-6992-4ee0-9a5c-f93c1b2717e7",
